WEBVTT

49:31.918 --> 49:35.254
Really?
That is so interesting.

49:36.506 --> 49:38.966
Would you like some tea,
Mrs Nesbitt?

49:39.593 --> 49:40.593
Buzz!

49:40.677 --> 49:43.554
It's so nice you could join us
on such late notice.

49:43.639 --> 49:47.224
-Oh, no!
-What a lovely hat, Mrs Nesbitt.

49:47.309 --> 49:49.477
It goes quite well with your head.

49:50.395 --> 49:52.855
Hannah! Oh, Hannah!

49:52.939 --> 49:55.691
Mom? Please excuse me, ladies.

49:55.776 --> 49:57.568
I'll be right back.
